WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Birds chirp as gentle orchestral music begins]

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
[A butterfly flutters through a sunny forest clearing]

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
[The butterfly passes flowers and tall grass]

00:15.500 --> 00:20.500
[The title “Big Buck Bunny” appears]

00:20.500 --> 00:25.500
[Soft music and woodland sounds continue]

00:25.500 --> 00:30.000
[Big Buck Bunny wakes beneath a tree]
